@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

title System Architecture for psmpi Communication and Verification

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "User Environment" {
    RECTANGLE User [
        <<actor>>
        - Developer/tester
        - Integrator
        - Maintainer
    ]

    RECTANGLE CommandLineInterface [
        CLI Tools
        --
        ./run-embedded-tests.sh
        ./autogen.sh
        ./configure
        make
    ]
}

package "Core System" {
    package "Embedded hwloc Verification" {
        RECTANGLE HwlocVerification [
            Manual Workflow
            --
            + Execute tests via script
            + Manual build & test
            + Not part of 'make check'
        ]
    }

    package "Communication Subsystem" {
        RECTANGLE CommDesign [
            Design Notes
            --
            + Initialization/Termination
            + Progress Advancement
            + Connection Establishment
            + One-to-Many Transfer
        ]

        RECTANGLE SendStateMachine [
            Send Path Logic
            --
            + Flow Control Checks
            + Direct Access Sends
            + Packet Buffer Packing
            + Rendezvous Handling
        ]
    }

    package "Libfabric Integration" {
        RECTANGLE LibfabricModule [
            Embedded Verbs Provider
            --
            + Conditional Build
            + Dependency Constraints
            + Linux Verbs API
        ]

        RECTANGLE VerbsDependencies [
            Required Libraries
            --
            libibverbs >= 1.1.8
            librdmacm >= 1.0.16
        ]
    }

    package "CH4 Network Layer" {
        RECTANGLE CH4Integration [
            Network Module Context
            --
            + OFI/libfabric Support
            + UCX Support
        ]
    }
}

package "External Systems" {
    RECTANGLE LinuxVerbs [
        Linux Verbs Stack
        --
        libibverbs
        librdmacm
    ]

    RECTANGLE NetworkHardware [
        Network Devices
        --
        RDMA Capable Hardware
    ]
}

User --> CommandLineInterface : uses
CommandLineInterface --> HwlocVerification : triggers
CommandLineInterface --> LibfabricModule : configures/builds

CommDesign --> SendStateMachine : describes
SendStateMachine --> NetworkHardware : interacts with

LibfabricModule --> VerbsDependencies : requires
LibfabricModule --> LinuxVerbs : interfaces with
CH4Integration --> LibfabricModule : integrates with

note right of HwlocVerification
    Manual verification workflows
    Executed via shell scripts
end note

note right of SendStateMachine
    Documented send path behavior:
    - Flow control checks
    - Direct access vs buffering
    - Rendezvous protocol fields
end note

note right of LibfabricModule
    Conditional build dependencies
    Version constraints applied
    Only active when enabled
end note

note bottom of VerbsDependencies
    Minimum version requirements
    Headers must match libraries
end note

@enduml
